Surfaced September 19, 2026 at 22:22 PDT. Activity date reported in the original review: March 11, 2026.

Two URLQuery reports, f4bdc296-568c-4320-9bd5-e7846a0b894b and d6669745-83d2-4628-82fa-87420ae6a5d7, concern Roi Et labor-force statistics in Thailand. Pastebin.k4be.pl page 1fad07cb contains the same request and numbers, is also dated March 11, and is displayed under the author label Sludgy Armadillo. That paste was already preserved by collusion.wiki.

The new contribution is the cross-service match linking early URLQuery activity to that known artifact. The original review described this as the earliest datapoint in the collusion.wiki inventory then checked, with the next on April 3;
